<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="id">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Kuis TKA Bahasa Inggris - Memahami Format & Karakteristik Teks</title>
<style>
:root{
  --primary:#2563eb;
  --primary-dark:#1d4ed8;
  --success:#15803d;
  --success-bg:#dcfce7;
  --danger:#b91c1c;
  --danger-bg:#fee2e2;
  --warning:#b45309;
  --warning-bg:#fef3c7;
  --bg:#f5f7fb;
  --card:#ffffff;
  --text:#1f2937;
  --muted:#64748b;
  --border:#e2e8f0;
}
*{box-sizing:border-box}
body{
  margin:0;
  font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;
  background:linear-gradient(180deg,#eff6ff 0%,var(--bg) 35%,#f8fafc 100%);
  color:var(--text);
  line-height:1.6;
}
.container{max-width:980px;margin:auto;padding:20px}
.hero{
  background:var(--card);
  border:1px solid var(--border);
  border-radius:20px;
  padding:28px 24px;
  box-shadow:0 10px 30px rgba(15,23,42,.07);
  margin-bottom:20px;
}
h1{margin:0 0 8px;font-size:clamp(25px,4vw,38px)}
.subtitle{margin:0;color:var(--muted)}
.stats{
  display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:12px;margin-top:20px
}
.stat{
  border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:14px;padding:14px;text-align:center;background:#f8fafc
}
.stat strong{display:block;font-size:22px}
.controls{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:10px;margin-top:18px}
button{
  border:0;border-radius:10px;padding:11px 15px;font-size:15px;font-weight:700;cursor:pointer
}
.btn-primary{background:var(--primary);color:white}
.btn-primary:hover{background:var(--primary-dark)}
.btn-secondary{background:#e2e8f0;color:#0f172a}
.progress-wrap{margin-top:18px}
.progress-bar{height:10px;background:#e2e8f0;border-radius:999px;overflow:hidden}
.progress-fill{height:100%;width:0;background:var(--primary);transition:.3s}
.quiz-card{
  background:var(--card);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:18px;
  padding:24px;margin-bottom:18px;box-shadow:0 7px 24px rgba(15,23,42,.05)
}
.question-head{display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:flex-start}
.number{
  min-width:38px;height:38px;border-radius:10px;background:#dbeafe;color:#1d4ed8;
  display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-weight:800
}
.type-tag{
  display:inline-block;font-size:12px;font-weight:700;padding:4px 8px;border-radius:999px;
  background:#f1f5f9;color:#475569;margin-bottom:8px
}
.question{font-size:18px;font-weight:700;margin:0}
.passage{
  background:#f8fafc;border-left:4px solid #93c5fd;padding:14px 16px;border-radius:8px;
  margin:15px 0;color:#334155
}
.options{display:grid;gap:10px;margin-top:16px}
.option{
  width:100%;text-align:left;background:#fff;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;color:#0f172a;
  font-weight:500;transition:.2s
}
.option:hover{background:#eff6ff;border-color:#93c5fd}
.option:disabled{cursor:not-allowed;opacity:1}
.option.correct{border-color:#86efac;background:var(--success-bg);color:#166534}
.option.wrong{border-color:#fca5a5;background:var(--danger-bg);color:#991b1b}
.feedback{display:none;margin-top:15px;padding:15px;border-radius:12px;font-weight:700}
.feedback.correct{display:block;background:var(--success-bg);color:var(--success)}
.feedback.wrong{display:block;background:var(--danger-bg);color:var(--danger)}
.explanation{
  display:none;margin-top:10px;padding:16px;background:#f8fafc;border:1px solid var(--border);
  border-radius:12px
}
.explanation strong{color:#0f172a}
.answer-key{font-size:13px;color:var(--muted);margin-top:8px}
.result{
  display:none;background:var(--card);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:18px;
  padding:24px;margin:20px 0;box-shadow:0 8px 25px rgba(15,23,42,.06)
}
.result h2{margin-top:0}
.badge{
  display:inline-block;padding:6px 10px;border-radius:999px;background:#dbeafe;color:#1d4ed8;
  font-weight:800
}
.footer{text-align:center;color:var(--muted);font-size:13px;padding:20px}
@media(max-width:700px){
  .container{padding:12px}
  .hero,.quiz-card,.result{padding:18px}
  .stats{grid-template-columns:1fr}
  .question{font-size:16px}
}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="container">
  <section class="hero">
    <h1>📝 Kuis TKA Bahasa Inggris SMA</h1>
    <p class="subtitle">Memahami Format & Karakteristik Teks — Level Pemula</p>

    <div class="stats">
      <div class="stat"><strong id="totalQ">0</strong><span>Soal</span></div>
      <div class="stat"><strong id="answered">0</strong><span>Terjawab</span></div>
      <div class="stat"><strong id="score">0</strong><span>Skor</span></div>
    </div>

    <div class="progress-wrap">
      <div class="progress-bar"><div id="progressFill" class="progress-fill"></div></div>
    </div>

    <div class="controls">
      <button class="btn-primary" onclick="scrollToFirstUnanswered()">➡️ Lanjut ke Soal Belum Dijawab</button>
      <button class="btn-secondary" onclick="resetQuiz()">🔄 Ulangi Kuis</button>
    </div>
  </section>

  <div id="quiz"></div>

  <section id="result" class="result">
    <h2>🎉 Hasil Latihan</h2>
    <p id="resultText"></p>
    <div id="resultAdvice"></div>
  </section>

  <div class="footer">
    Belajar reading bukan tentang memahami setiap kata. Fokus pada pesan, struktur, kata kunci, dan bukti dari teks.
  </div>
</div>

